  "body_html": "<p>Embrace faith and comfort with our Custom Bible Verse Christian Blanket from Jeminise. This personalized blanket combines soft, skin-friendly fabric with inspiring scripture, making it a perfect thoughtful gift for a loved one or a meaningful addition to your home for prayer and quiet reflection.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Features uplifting bible verses, butterflies, floral, cloud, and cross patterns, ideal for Christian women and girls.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Add a name or date to create a unique and cherished keepsake, offering a personal touch to this inspirational gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from skin-friendly fabric, ensuring warmth, peace, and daily encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit various needs and uses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Gift:</strong> A perfect gift for birthdays, Christmas, baptisms, or any occasion for those who cherish inspiration and faith-filled homes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat; microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for all seasons and recommended for indoor use, providing comfort and spiritual encouragement.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>S/M/L/XL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses For Product</th>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Age Range Description</th>\n<td>Adult, Kids</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
